    <h1>Beyond the game.</h1>
    <p><strong>M/KE</strong> (said "Mike") is an independent esports media company. We cover League of Legends first, starting with the LEC, with news, interviews, features and analysis about the people, competition and culture shaping the scene.</p>
    <p>Read <a href={url('/standards/')}>how we report</a>, follow <a href="https://x.com/mkeggcom">@mkeggcom</a> on X, or write to <a href="mailto:contact@mkegg.com">contact@mkegg.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
